  <document-link format="APPLICATION/MSWORD" url="https://aidstream.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/documents/completed_sahel-2023-%28education%29-20250304060350.pdf">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Education as a key driver of hope in Sahel</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Oxfam and partners in the Sahel region have achieved remarkable results related to financing for education and advancing gender transformative education in compulsory education and technical vocational training. TVET. Financing has increased both in Niger and Burkina Faso, ranging from 5% in Mogt&#xe9;do to 76% in Nagr&#xe9;ongo and local civil society groups have achieved to ensure education as a priority in the local budgets which cover for education. This change is remarkable given the challenging conditions for civil society in the two countries.</narrative>
   </description>
